<!-- WHY -->
<section style="padding:84px 24px;background:#fff;">
  <div class="why-grid" style="max-width:1120px;margin:0 auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr 0.9fr;gap:64px;align-items:center;">
    <div>
      <span class="kicker">What Makes Us Different</span>
      <h2 class="section-heading" style="font-size:clamp(26px,3.4vw,40px);margin:0 0 28px;">Plain structural advice for Perth homes, from an independent engineer</h2>
      <ul style="list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:20px;">
          <li style="display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:flex-start;">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#1F5E8C" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="flex-shrink:0;margin-top:3px;"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            <div>
              <p style="font-family:'Figtree',sans-serif;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;color:#15191E;margin:0 0 4px;">An engineer, not a building inspector</p>
              <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#5A6B76;margin:0;">Plenty of Perth 'structural inspections' are AS 4349.1 pre-purchase reports written by building inspectors. Enquiries here go to a structural engineering firm instead.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li style="display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:flex-start;">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#1F5E8C" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="flex-shrink:0;margin-top:3px;"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            <div>
              <p style="font-family:'Figtree',sans-serif;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;color:#15191E;margin:0 0 4px;">Upfront about who pays</p>
              <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#5A6B76;margin:0;">The engineering firm pays to advertise on this site. It quotes you and contracts with you directly, so you always know who you're dealing with.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li style="display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:flex-start;">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#1F5E8C" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="flex-shrink:0;margin-top:3px;"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            <div>
              <p style="font-family:'Figtree',sans-serif;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;color:#15191E;margin:0 0 4px;">Told when you don't need an engineer</p>
              <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#5A6B76;margin:0;">Some jobs are exempt from a permit, and some questions belong with a builder or building surveyor first. The guides here say so, even when it means no job.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li style="display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:flex-start;">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#1F5E8C" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="flex-shrink:0;margin-top:3px;"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            <div>
              <p style="font-family:'Figtree',sans-serif;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;color:#15191E;margin:0 0 4px;">WA rules, quoted from the source</p>
              <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#5A6B76;margin:0;">Permit fees, decision times and exemptions on this site come from the Building Regulations 2012 and wa.gov.au. The engineer's own fee is quoted per job, not guessed at.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:20px;">
      <div style="border-radius:18px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 18px 44px rgba(10,61,92,0.2);aspect-ratio:4/5;">
        <img src="/images/hero-800.webp" alt="Kings Park Structural Co at work" width="800" height="800" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block;" loading="lazy">
      </div>
      <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:20px;">
