<!-- PROCESS -->
<section style="padding:76px 24px;background:#F1ECE2;">
  <div style="max-width:1020px;margin:0 auto;text-align:center;">
    <span class="kicker">How It Works</span>
    <h2 class="section-heading" style="font-size:clamp(26px,3.4vw,38px);margin:0 0 44px;">Three Steps: Tell Us, Get a Quote, Book the Engineer.</h2>
    <div class="steps-grid" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:32px;">
      <div style="background:#fff;border-radius:16px;padding:34px 26px;box-shadow:0 4px 18px rgba(10,61,92,0.08);">
        <div style="width:54px;height:54px;border-radius:50%;background:#1F5E8C;color:#fff;font-family:'Figtree',sans-serif;font-size:22px;font-weight:800;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin:0 auto 16px;">1</div>
        <h3 style="font-family:'Figtree',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#15191E;margin:0 0 10px;">Enquiry and a proper conversation</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#5A6B76;margin:0;">Call or send photos and any plans you have. The engineer asks what you want to change, or what you've noticed and when it started, and tells you whether it sounds like engineering work at all.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border-radius:16px;padding:34px 26px;box-shadow:0 4px 18px rgba(10,61,92,0.08);">
        <div style="width:54px;height:54px;border-radius:50%;background:#1F5E8C;color:#fff;font-family:'Figtree',sans-serif;font-size:22px;font-weight:800;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin:0 auto 16px;">2</div>
        <h3 style="font-family:'Figtree',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#15191E;margin:0 0 10px;">Site visit and scope</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#5A6B76;margin:0;">Photos and plans are enough for some jobs. Others need the engineer on site, in the roof space or looking at the brickwork, before the scope is pinned down.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border-radius:16px;padding:34px 26px;box-shadow:0 4px 18px rgba(10,61,92,0.08);">
        <div style="width:54px;height:54px;border-radius:50%;background:#1F5E8C;color:#fff;font-family:'Figtree',sans-serif;font-size:22px;font-weight:800;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin:0 auto 16px;">3</div>
        <h3 style="font-family:'Figtree',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#15191E;margin:0 0 10px;">Written proposal, then the work</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#5A6B76;margin:0;">You get a written quote setting out the fee and what's included. Once you accept it, the engineer delivers the report, beam design, drawings or certificate the job needs.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
